# SpendWise has no .env settings. Configuration lives in:
#
#   wrangler.jsonc   bindings and plain vars
#     DB                D1 database "spendwise-db"
#     STATEMENTS        R2 bucket "spendwise-statements" (uploaded bank statements)
#     AUTH_LIMITER      rate limit for sign-in attempts
#     CF_AI_WORKER_URL  URL of the spendwise-ai worker
#
#   .dev.vars        local secrets (gitignored); copy .dev.vars.example
#     CF_AI_WORKER_SECRET  same value as API_SECRET on the spendwise-ai worker
#
# In production, set secrets with: npx wrangler secret put CF_AI_WORKER_SECRET
